# SSR | TanStack Start React Docs
created: 2017-02-01, last updated: 2025-03-29, [Read more](https://tanstack.com/start/latest/docs/framework/react/ssr)

TanStack Start supports server-side rendering out of the box.
To enable server-side rendering, create an app/ssr.tsx file in your project:
```
// app/ssr.tsx
import {
createStartHandler,
defaultStreamHandler,
} from '@tanstack/react-start/server'
import { getRouterManifest } from '@tanstack/react-start/router-manifest'
import { createRouter } from './router'
export default createStartHandler({
createRouter,
getRouterManifest,
})(defaultStreamHandler)
```
